            "value" : "เริ่ม Xbox ของคุณ"
          }
        },
        "tr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Xbox'ınızı Açın"
          }
        },
        "ur" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "اپنا Xbox شروع کریں"
          }
        },
        "vi" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Khởi động Xbox"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "In Greenlight, sign in with Microsoft, pick your Xbox and press Start. Nino reads that window." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ar" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "في Greenlight سجّل الدخول بحساب Microsoft، واختر جهاز Xbox واضغط ابدأ. يقرأ Nino تلك النافذة."
          }
        },
        "bn" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Greenlight-এ Microsoft দিয়ে সাইন ইন করুন, আপনার Xbox বেছে নিন এবং Start চাপুন। Nino সেই উইন্ডোটি পড়ে।"
          }
        },
        "fil" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Sa Greenlight, mag-sign in gamit ang Microsoft, piliin ang iyong Xbox at pindutin ang Start. Binabasa ng Nino ang window na iyon."
          }
        },
        "hi" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Greenlight में Microsoft से साइन इन करें, अपना Xbox चुनें और Start दबाएँ। Nino उस विंडो को पढ़ता है।"
          }
        },
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Di Greenlight, masuk dengan Microsoft, pilih Xbox Anda, lalu tekan Start. Nino membaca jendela tersebut."
          }
        },
        "ms" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Dalam Greenlight, log masuk dengan Microsoft, pilih Xbox anda dan tekan Start. Nino membaca tetingkap itu."
          }
        },
        "nl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Log in Greenlight in met Microsoft, kies je Xbox en druk op Start. Nino leest dat venster."
          }
        },
        "th" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "ใน Greenlight ให้ลงชื่อเข้าด้วย Microsoft เลือก Xbox ของคุณ แล้วกด Start Nino จะอ่านหน้าต่างนั้น"
          }
        },
        "tr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Greenlight'ta Microsoft hesabınızla girin, Xbox'ınızı seçip Başlat'a basın. Nino o pencereyi okur."
          }
        },
        "ur" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Greenlight میں Microsoft سے سائن اِن کریں، اپنا Xbox چنیں اور Start دبائیں۔ Nino وہ ونڈو پڑھتا ہے۔"
          }
        },
        "vi" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Trong Greenlight, đăng nhập bằng Microsoft, chọn Xbox của bạn và bấm Start. Nino sẽ đọc cửa sổ đó."
          }
        }
      }
    },
