        "nl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "De gratis vertaling van Apple ondersteunt deze taal nog niet. Zet AI-vertaling aan in Instellingen › Vertaling; Gemini is gratis."
          }
        },
        "th" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "การแปลฟรีของ Apple ยังไม่รองรับภาษานี้ โปรดเปิดการแปลด้วย AI ใน การตั้งค่า › การแปล โดย Gemini ใช้ได้ฟรี"
          }
        },
        "tr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Apple'ın ücretsiz çevirisi bu dili henüz desteklemiyor. Ayarlar › Çeviri'den yapay zekâ çevirisini açın; Gemini ücretsizdir."
          }
        },
        "ur" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Apple کا مفت ترجمہ ابھی اس زبان کو سپورٹ نہیں کرتا۔ Settings › Translation میں AI ترجمہ آن کریں؛ Gemini مفت ہے۔"
          }
        },
        "vi" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Bản dịch miễn phí của Apple chưa hỗ trợ ngôn ngữ này. Hãy bật dịch bằng AI trong Cài đặt › Dịch; Gemini miễn phí."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Game packs, the term list and dubbing work only for Turkish. Other languages come from the translation engine you chose (the free translation, Gemini, ChatGPT, Claude, DeepL or a local model). On Windows, Thai, Urdu, Bengali, Malay and Filipino need an AI engine; Gemini is free." : {
