          }
        }
      }
    },
    "2. On the TV, install the Developer Mode app from the LG Content Store, open it, sign in with your account and turn on Dev Mode Status. The TV restarts." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ar" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "2. على TV، ثبّت تطبيق Developer Mode من LG Content Store، وافتحه، وسجّل الدخول بحسابك، وفعّل Dev Mode Status. سيُعاد تشغيل TV."
          }
        },
        "bn" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "২. TV-তে LG Content Store থেকে Developer Mode অ্যাপ ইনস্টল করুন, খুলুন, আপনার অ্যাকাউন্ট দিয়ে সাইন ইন করে Dev Mode Status চালু করুন। TV রিস্টার্ট হবে।"
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "2. On the TV, install the Developer Mode app from the LG Content Store, open it, sign in with your account and turn on Dev Mode Status. The TV restarts."
          }
        },
        "fil" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "2. Sa TV, i-install ang Developer Mode app mula sa LG Content Store, buksan ito, mag-sign in gamit ang iyong account at i-on ang Dev Mode Status. Magre-restart ang TV."
          }
        },
        "hi" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "2. TV पर LG Content Store से Developer Mode ऐप इंस्टॉल करें, उसे खोलें, अपने अकाउंट से साइन इन करें और Dev Mode Status चालू करें। TV रीस्टार्ट होगा।"
          }
        },
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "2. Di TV, pasang aplikasi Developer Mode dari LG Content Store, buka, masuk dengan akun Anda, lalu aktifkan Dev Mode Status. TV akan dimulai ulang."
          }
        },
        "ms" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "2. Pada TV, pasang apl Developer Mode daripada LG Content Store, bukanya, log masuk dengan akaun anda dan hidupkan Dev Mode Status. TV akan dimulakan semula."
          }
        },
        "nl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "2. Installeer op de TV de app Developer Mode uit de LG Content Store, open hem, log in met je account en zet Dev Mode Status aan. De TV herstart."
          }
        },
        "th" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "2. บน TV ให้ติดตั้งแอป Developer Mode จาก LG Content Store เปิดแอป ลงชื่อเข้าใช้ด้วยบัญชีของคุณ แล้วเปิด Dev Mode Status TV จะรีสตาร์ต"
          }
        },
        "tr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "2. TV'de LG Content Store'dan Developer Mode uygulamasını kurun, açıp hesabınızla giriş yapın ve Dev Mode Status'u açın. TV yeniden başlar."
          }
        },
        "ur" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "2. TV پر LG Content Store سے Developer Mode ایپ انسٹال کریں، اسے کھولیں، اپنے اکاؤنٹ سے سائن ان کریں اور Dev Mode Status آن کریں۔ TV ری اسٹارٹ ہوگا۔"
          }
        },
        "vi" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "2. Trên TV, cài ứng dụng Developer Mode từ LG Content Store, mở ứng dụng, đăng nhập bằng tài khoản của bạn và bật Dev Mode Status. TV sẽ khởi động lại."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "3. Open the Developer Mode app again and turn on Key Server. Leave the app on screen; a 6-character Passphrase appears at the bottom left." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ar" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "3. افتح تطبيق Developer Mode مرة أخرى وفعّل Key Server. اترك التطبيق على الشاشة؛ ستظهر عبارة مرور (Passphrase) من 6 أحرف في أسفل اليسار."
          }
        },
        "bn" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "৩. Developer Mode অ্যাপটি আবার খুলে Key Server চালু করুন। অ্যাপটি স্ক্রিনে রেখে দিন; নিচে বাঁয়ে ৬ অক্ষরের একটি Passphrase দেখাবে।"
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "3. Open the Developer Mode app again and turn on Key Server. Leave the app on screen; a 6-character Passphrase appears at the bottom left."
          }
        },
        "fil" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "3. Buksan ulit ang Developer Mode app at i-on ang Key Server. Iwan ang app sa screen; lalabas ang 6 na character na Passphrase sa kaliwa sa ibaba."
          }
        },
        "hi" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "3. Developer Mode ऐप फिर से खोलें और Key Server चालू करें। ऐप स्क्रीन पर रहने दें; नीचे बाईं ओर 6 अक्षरों का Passphrase दिखेगा।"
          }
        },
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "3. Buka lagi aplikasi Developer Mode dan aktifkan Key Server. Biarkan aplikasi tetap di layar; Passphrase 6 karakter muncul di kiri bawah."
          }
        },
        "ms" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "3. Buka apl Developer Mode sekali lagi dan hidupkan Key Server. Biarkan apl pada skrin; Passphrase 6 aksara muncul di bahagian bawah kiri."
          }
        },
        "nl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "3. Open de app Developer Mode opnieuw en zet Key Server aan. Laat de app op het scherm staan; linksonder verschijnt een Passphrase van 6 tekens."
          }
        },
        "th" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "3. เปิดแอป Developer Mode อีกครั้งแล้วเปิด Key Server เปิดแอปค้างไว้บนหน้าจอ Passphrase 6 ตัวอักษรจะแสดงที่มุมล่างซ้าย"
          }
        },
        "tr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "3. Developer Mode uygulamasını yeniden açın ve Key Server'ı açın. Uygulamayı ekranda bırakın; sol altta 6 karakterli Passphrase görünür."
          }
        },
        "ur" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "3. Developer Mode ایپ دوبارہ کھولیں اور Key Server آن کریں۔ ایپ اسکرین پر رہنے دیں؛ نیچے بائیں طرف 6 حروف کا Passphrase نظر آئے گا۔"
          }
        },
        "vi" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "3. Mở lại ứng dụng Developer Mode và bật Key Server. Để ứng dụng trên màn hình; một Passphrase 6 ký tự sẽ hiện ở góc dưới bên trái."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "4. Type the Passphrase above and press Install and open. The passphrase is only needed for the first install." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ar" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "4. اكتب عبارة المرور أعلاه واضغط «التثبيت والفتح». لا تلزم عبارة المرور إلا في التثبيت الأول."
          }
        },
        "bn" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "৪. ওপরে Passphrase লিখে ইনস্টল করে খুলুন চাপুন। Passphrase শুধু প্রথম ইনস্টলের জন্য দরকার।"
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "4. Type the Passphrase above and press Install and open. The passphrase is only needed for the first install."
          }
        },
        "fil" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "4. I-type ang Passphrase sa itaas at pindutin ang I-install at buksan. Sa unang pag-install lang kailangan ang passphrase."
          }
        },
        "hi" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "4. ऊपर Passphrase लिखें और इंस्टॉल करें और खोलें दबाएँ। Passphrase सिर्फ़ पहली बार इंस्टॉल करने के लिए चाहिए।"
          }
        },
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "4. Ketik Passphrase di atas lalu tekan Pasang dan buka. Passphrase hanya diperlukan untuk pemasangan pertama."
          }
        },
        "ms" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "4. Taip Passphrase di atas dan tekan Pasang dan buka. Frasa laluan hanya diperlukan untuk pemasangan pertama."
          }
        },
        "nl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "4. Typ de Passphrase hierboven en druk op Installeren en openen. De passphrase is alleen nodig bij de eerste installatie."
          }
        },
        "th" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "4. พิมพ์ Passphrase ด้านบนแล้วกด ติดตั้งและเปิด ต้องใช้ Passphrase เฉพาะการติดตั้งครั้งแรก"
          }
        },
        "tr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "4. Passphrase'i yukarıya yazın ve Kur ve aç'a basın. Parola yalnız ilk kurulumda gerekir."
          }
        },
        "ur" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "4. اوپر Passphrase لکھیں اور انسٹال کریں اور کھولیں دبائیں۔ Passphrase صرف پہلی انسٹالیشن کے لیے درکار ہے۔"
          }
        },
        "vi" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "4. Nhập Passphrase ở trên và nhấn Cài và mở. Passphrase chỉ cần cho lần cài đầu tiên."
          }
        }
      }
    },
