          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "TV پر ڈیبگنگ آن کریں"
          }
        },
        "vi" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Bật gỡ lỗi trên TV"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "1. Turn on developer options: on the TV, open Settings › System (or Device Preferences) › About and press the Android TV OS build row 7 times." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ar" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "1. فعّل خيارات المطوّر: على TV، افتح الإعدادات › النظام (أو إعدادات الجهاز المفضّلة) › حول، واضغط على صف «إصدار Android TV OS» 7 مرات."
          }
        },
        "bn" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "১. ডেভেলপার অপশন চালু করুন: TV-তে Settings › System (বা Device Preferences) › About খুলে Android TV OS build সারিতে ৭ বার চাপুন।"
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "1. Turn on developer options: on the TV, open Settings › System (or Device Preferences) › About and press the Android TV OS build row 7 times."
          }
        },
        "fil" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "1. I-on ang developer options: sa TV, buksan ang Settings › System (o Device Preferences) › About at pindutin nang 7 beses ang row na Android TV OS build."
          }
        },
        "hi" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "1. डेवलपर विकल्प चालू करें: TV पर सेटिंग्स › सिस्टम (या डिवाइस प्राथमिकताएँ) › परिचय खोलें और Android TV OS बिल्ड वाली पंक्ति 7 बार दबाएँ।"
          }
        },
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "1. Aktifkan opsi pengembang: di TV, buka Settings › System (atau Device Preferences) › About lalu tekan baris Android TV OS build 7 kali."
          }
        },
        "ms" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "1. Hidupkan pilihan pembangun: pada TV, buka Settings › System (atau Device Preferences) › About dan tekan baris Android TV OS build sebanyak 7 kali."
          }
        },
        "nl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "1. Zet de ontwikkelaarsopties aan: open op de TV Instellingen › Systeem (of Apparaatvoorkeuren) › Over en druk 7 keer op de rij Android TV OS-build."
          }
        },
        "th" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "1. เปิดตัวเลือกสำหรับนักพัฒนา: บน TV ให้เปิด การตั้งค่า › ระบบ (หรือ ค่ากำหนดของอุปกรณ์) › เกี่ยวกับ แล้วกดแถว บิลด์ Android TV OS 7 ครั้ง"
          }
        },
        "tr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "1. Geliştirici seçeneklerini açın: TV'de Ayarlar › Sistem (ya da Cihaz Tercihleri) › Hakkında › Android TV OS derlemesi satırına 7 kez basın."
          }
        },
        "ur" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "1. ڈیولپر آپشنز آن کریں: TV پر Settings › System (یا Device Preferences) › About کھولیں اور Android TV OS build والی قطار 7 بار دبائیں۔"
          }
        },
        "vi" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "1. Bật tùy chọn nhà phát triển: trên TV, mở Cài đặt › Hệ thống (hoặc Tùy chọn thiết bị) › Giới thiệu và nhấn vào dòng Bản dựng Android TV OS 7 lần."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "2. In Settings › System › Developer options, turn on USB debugging. Some TVs also have “Network debugging” or “ADB over network”; turn that on too." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ar" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "2. في الإعدادات › النظام › خيارات المطوّر، فعّل تصحيح أخطاء USB. بعض أجهزة TV تحتوي أيضًا على «تصحيح الأخطاء عبر الشبكة» أو «ADB عبر الشبكة»؛ فعّله أيضًا."
          }
        },
        "bn" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "২. Settings › System › Developer options-এ USB debugging চালু করুন। কিছু TV-তে “Network debugging” বা “ADB over network”-ও থাকে; সেটিও চালু করুন।"
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "2. In Settings › System › Developer options, turn on USB debugging. Some TVs also have “Network debugging” or “ADB over network”; turn that on too."
          }
        },
        "fil" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "2. Sa Settings › System › Developer options, i-on ang USB debugging. May “Network debugging” o “ADB over network” din ang ilang TV; i-on din iyon."
          }
        },
        "hi" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "2. सेटिंग्स › सिस्टम › डेवलपर विकल्प में USB डीबगिंग चालू करें। कुछ TV में “नेटवर्क डीबगिंग” या “ADB over network” भी होता है; उसे भी चालू करें।"
          }
        },
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "2. Di Settings › System › Developer options, aktifkan USB debugging. Beberapa TV juga punya “Network debugging” atau “ADB over network”; aktifkan juga."
          }
        },
        "ms" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "2. Dalam Settings › System › Developer options, hidupkan USB debugging. Sesetengah TV juga mempunyai “Network debugging” atau “ADB over network”; hidupkannya juga."
          }
        },
        "nl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "2. Zet in Instellingen › Systeem › Ontwikkelaarsopties USB-foutopsporing aan. Sommige TV's hebben ook ‘Netwerkfoutopsporing’ of ‘ADB via netwerk’; zet dat ook aan."
          }
        },
        "th" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "2. ใน การตั้งค่า › ระบบ › ตัวเลือกสำหรับนักพัฒนา ให้เปิดการแก้ไขข้อบกพร่อง USB TV บางรุ่นมี “การแก้ไขข้อบกพร่องผ่านเครือข่าย” หรือ “ADB over network” ด้วย ให้เปิดไว้ด้วย"
          }
        },
        "tr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "2. Ayarlar › Sistem › Geliştirici seçenekleri'nde USB hata ayıklama'yı açın. Bazı TV'lerde ayrıca “Ağ hata ayıklaması” ya da “ADB over network” olur; onu da açın."
          }
        },
        "ur" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "2. Settings › System › Developer options میں USB debugging آن کریں۔ کچھ TV میں “Network debugging” یا “ADB over network” بھی ہوتا ہے؛ اسے بھی آن کریں۔"
          }
        },
        "vi" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "2. Trong Cài đặt › Hệ thống › Tùy chọn nhà phát triển, bật Gỡ lỗi USB. Một số TV còn có “Gỡ lỗi qua mạng” hoặc “ADB qua mạng”; hãy bật cả mục đó."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "3. Press Install and open. When the TV asks “Allow USB debugging?”, tick “Always allow from this device” and choose Allow. If it cannot connect, try the Wireless debugging option (Android 11 and later, Google TV)." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ar" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "3. اضغط «التثبيت والفتح». عندما يسأل TV «السماح بتصحيح أخطاء USB؟»، حدّد «السماح دائمًا من هذا الجهاز» واختر «السماح». إذا تعذّر الاتصال، جرّب خيار تصحيح الأخطاء اللاسلكي (Android 11 وما بعده، Google TV)."
          }
        },
        "bn" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "৩. ইনস্টল করে খুলুন চাপুন। TV “Allow USB debugging?” জিজ্ঞেস করলে “Always allow from this device” টিক দিয়ে Allow বেছে নিন। সংযোগ না হলে ওয়্যারলেস ডিবাগিং অপশনটি চেষ্টা করুন (Android 11 ও পরের, Google TV)।"
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "3. Press Install and open. When the TV asks “Allow USB debugging?”, tick “Always allow from this device” and choose Allow. If it cannot connect, try the Wireless debugging option (Android 11 and later, Google TV)."
          }
        },
        "fil" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "3. Pindutin ang I-install at buksan. Kapag tinanong ng TV ang “Allow USB debugging?”, lagyan ng tsek ang “Always allow from this device” at piliin ang Allow. Kung hindi makakonekta, subukan ang opsyong Wireless debugging (Android 11 pataas, Google TV)."
          }
        },
        "hi" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "3. इंस्टॉल करें और खोलें दबाएँ। जब TV पूछे “Allow USB debugging?”, तो “Always allow from this device” पर टिक करें और Allow चुनें। अगर कनेक्ट न हो, तो वायरलेस डीबगिंग विकल्प आज़माएँ (Android 11 और बाद के, Google TV)।"
          }
        },
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "3. Tekan Pasang dan buka. Saat TV bertanya “Allow USB debugging?”, centang “Always allow from this device” lalu pilih Allow. Jika tidak dapat terhubung, coba opsi Debugging nirkabel (Android 11 dan yang lebih baru, Google TV)."
          }
        },
        "ms" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "3. Tekan Pasang dan buka. Apabila TV bertanya “Allow USB debugging?”, tandakan “Always allow from this device” dan pilih Allow. Jika tidak dapat menyambung, cuba pilihan Penyahpepijatan wayarles (Android 11 dan lebih baharu, Google TV)."
          }
        },
        "nl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "3. Druk op Installeren en openen. Vraagt de TV ‘USB-foutopsporing toestaan?’, vink dan ‘Altijd toestaan vanaf deze computer’ aan en kies Toestaan. Lukt het verbinden niet, probeer dan de optie Draadloze foutopsporing (Android 11 en later, Google TV)."
          }
        },
        "th" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "3. กด ติดตั้งและเปิด เมื่อ TV ถาม “อนุญาตการแก้ไขข้อบกพร่อง USB ไหม” ให้ติ๊ก “อนุญาตจากอุปกรณ์นี้เสมอ” แล้วเลือก อนุญาต หากเชื่อมต่อไม่ได้ ให้ลองตัวเลือกการแก้ไขข้อบกพร่องแบบไร้สาย (Android 11 ขึ้นไป, Google TV)"
          }
        },
        "tr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "3. Kur ve aç'a basın. TV'de “USB hata ayıklamasına izin verilsin mi?” çıkınca “Bu cihazdan her zaman izin ver”i işaretleyip İzin ver'i seçin. Bağlanamazsanız Kablosuz hata ayıklama yolunu deneyin (Android 11 ve sonrası, Google TV)."
          }
        },
        "ur" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "3. انسٹال کریں اور کھولیں دبائیں۔ جب TV پوچھے “Allow USB debugging?” تو “Always allow from this device” پر نشان لگا کر Allow منتخب کریں۔ اگر کنکشن نہ ہو تو وائرلیس ڈیبگنگ والا آپشن آزمائیں (Android 11 اور بعد کے، Google TV)۔"
          }
        },
        "vi" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "3. Nhấn Cài và mở. Khi TV hỏi “Cho phép gỡ lỗi USB?”, đánh dấu “Luôn cho phép từ thiết bị này” và chọn Cho phép. Nếu không kết nối được, hãy thử tùy chọn Gỡ lỗi không dây (Android 11 trở lên, Google TV)."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "2. Turn on Developer options › Wireless debugging and open it. Type the “IP address & Port” at the top as the TV's address." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ar" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "2. فعّل خيارات المطوّر › تصحيح الأخطاء اللاسلكي وافتحه. اكتب «عنوان IP والمنفذ» الظاهر في الأعلى بوصفه عنوان TV."
          }
        },
        "bn" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "২. Developer options › Wireless debugging চালু করে খুলুন। ওপরে থাকা “IP address & Port” TV-র ঠিকানা হিসেবে লিখুন।"
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "2. Turn on Developer options › Wireless debugging and open it. Type the “IP address & Port” at the top as the TV's address."
          }
        },
        "fil" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "2. I-on ang Developer options › Wireless debugging at buksan ito. I-type ang “IP address & Port” sa itaas bilang address ng TV."
          }
        },
        "hi" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "2. डेवलपर विकल्प › वायरलेस डीबगिंग चालू करें और उसे खोलें। सबसे ऊपर दिया “IP address & Port” TV के पते के रूप में लिखें।"
          }
        },
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "2. Aktifkan Developer options › Wireless debugging lalu buka. Ketik “IP address & Port” yang ada di bagian atas sebagai alamat TV."
          }
        },
        "ms" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "2. Hidupkan Developer options › Wireless debugging dan bukanya. Taip “IP address & Port” di bahagian atas sebagai alamat TV."
          }
        },
        "nl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "2. Zet Ontwikkelaarsopties › Draadloze foutopsporing aan en open het. Typ het ‘IP-adres en poort’ bovenaan als adres van de TV."
          }
        },
        "th" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "2. เปิด ตัวเลือกสำหรับนักพัฒนา › การแก้ไขข้อบกพร่องแบบไร้สาย แล้วแตะเข้าไป พิมพ์ “ที่อยู่ IP และพอร์ต” ที่ด้านบนเป็นที่อยู่ของ TV"
          }
        },
        "tr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "2. Geliştirici seçenekleri › Kablosuz hata ayıklama'yı açın, içine girin. Üstteki “IP adresi ve bağlantı noktası”nı TV'nin adresine yazın."
          }
        },
        "ur" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "2. Developer options › Wireless debugging آن کریں اور اسے کھولیں۔ اوپر موجود “IP address & Port” کو TV کے ایڈریس کے طور پر لکھیں۔"
          }
        },
        "vi" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "2. Bật Tùy chọn nhà phát triển › Gỡ lỗi không dây và mở mục đó. Nhập “Địa chỉ IP và cổng” ở trên cùng làm địa chỉ TV."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "3. The first time, press “Pair device with pairing code”; type the IP address and port from that window together with the 6-digit code, and press Install and open while the window is still open." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ar" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "3. في المرة الأولى، اضغط «إقران الجهاز باستخدام رمز الاقتران»؛ واكتب عنوان IP والمنفذ من تلك النافذة مع الرمز المكوّن من 6 أرقام، واضغط «التثبيت والفتح» والنافذة لا تزال مفتوحة."
          }
        },
        "bn" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "৩. প্রথমবার “Pair device with pairing code” চাপুন; সেই উইন্ডোর IP ঠিকানা ও পোর্ট ৬ অঙ্কের কোডসহ লিখুন, এবং উইন্ডোটি খোলা থাকতেই ইনস্টল করে খুলুন চাপুন।"
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "3. The first time, press “Pair device with pairing code”; type the IP address and port from that window together with the 6-digit code, and press Install and open while the window is still open."
          }
        },
        "fil" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "3. Sa unang pagkakataon, pindutin ang “Pair device with pairing code”; i-type ang IP address at port mula sa window na iyon kasama ang 6 na digit na code, at pindutin ang I-install at buksan habang bukas pa ang window."
          }
        },
        "hi" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "3. पहली बार “Pair device with pairing code” दबाएँ; उस विंडो का IP पता और पोर्ट 6 अंकों के कोड के साथ लिखें, और विंडो खुली रहते हुए ही इंस्टॉल करें और खोलें दबाएँ।"
          }
        },
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "3. Untuk pertama kali, tekan “Pair device with pairing code”; ketik alamat IP dan port dari jendela itu bersama kode 6 digit, lalu tekan Pasang dan buka selagi jendela masih terbuka."
          }
        },
        "ms" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "3. Kali pertama, tekan “Pair device with pairing code”; taip alamat IP dan port daripada tetingkap itu bersama kod 6 digit, dan tekan Pasang dan buka semasa tetingkap masih terbuka."
          }
        },
        "nl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "3. Druk de eerste keer op ‘Apparaat koppelen met koppelingscode’; typ het IP-adres en de poort uit dat venster samen met de code van 6 cijfers en druk op Installeren en openen terwijl het venster nog open is."
          }
        },
        "th" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "3. ครั้งแรก ให้กด “จับคู่อุปกรณ์ด้วยรหัสการจับคู่” พิมพ์ที่อยู่ IP และพอร์ตจากหน้าต่างนั้นพร้อมรหัส 6 หลัก แล้วกด ติดตั้งและเปิด ขณะที่หน้าต่างยังเปิดอยู่"
          }
        },
        "tr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "3. İlk kurulumda “Cihazı eşleme kodu ile eşle”ye basın; açılan penceredeki IP adresi ve portu, 6 haneli kodla birlikte buraya yazın ve pencere açıkken Kur ve aç'a basın."
          }
        },
        "ur" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "3. پہلی بار “Pair device with pairing code” دبائیں؛ اس ونڈو کا IP ایڈریس اور پورٹ 6 ہندسوں کے کوڈ کے ساتھ لکھیں، اور ونڈو کھلی ہوتے ہوئے انسٹال کریں اور کھولیں دبائیں۔"
          }
        },
        "vi" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "3. Lần đầu tiên, nhấn “Ghép nối thiết bị bằng mã ghép nối”; nhập địa chỉ IP và cổng từ cửa sổ đó cùng với mã 6 chữ số, rồi nhấn Cài và mở khi cửa sổ vẫn đang mở."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Remove the TV's copy and install" : {
      "localizations" : {
